      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "To help improve asthma care, Primary Care Commissioning (PCC) has launched a practice guide for professionals, including emergency care staff, involved in care of people with asthma. It explains the case for improving outcomes for people with asthma and presents case studies to describe what good services should be like. One section looks specifically at the emergency management of acute episodes and makes several recommendations."},
